        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Republican voters who prioritize environmental protection face a disconnect between their values and dominant policy narratives.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a gap between actual conservative viewpoints on climate change and how those views are portrayed in public discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience has sufficient familiarity with conservative perspectives on environmental policy to engage meaningfully with the topic.",
