    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "It's a great question and I've looked at this pretty extensively. Number one, we have to embrace our heritage. Conservatives are the original conservationist. Teddy Roosevelt started the conservation movement. Teddy Roosevelt was a Republican. If you look at what the leftox tree fur to is the bedrock environmental laws of our country, most of those were done under Richard Nixon. You have the Clean Water Act, the Clean Air Act, the Endangered Species Act, the formation of the EPA. All of these were done with good intent and purpose. for the right reasons and the the left bastardized it they've taken these laws and weaponized them and they're actually preventing",
